---
// This is a client-side redirection page designed to avoid browser back-button loops.
// Static rendering is used.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Redirecting to Play Store...</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.selalink.buildself">
  <script is:inline>
    // location.replace overrides history stack entry so user doesn't get stuck on back button
    window.location.replace("https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.selalink.buildself");
  </script>
</head>
<body style="background-color: #0f172a; color: #94a3b8; font-family: sans-serif; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; margin: 0;">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <p>스토어로 이동 중입니다...</p>
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">자동으로 이동하지 않으면 <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.selalink.buildself" style="color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: underline;">여기</a>를 클릭하세요.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
